        },
        {
          "source_path": "Purchase Dispute/subflows/Promo Code Invalid/actions/2/subtext/1",
          "source_text": "Then [Ask the Oracle] if the customer made an error, which will return Yes or No"
        },
        {
          "source_path": "Purchase Dispute/subflows/Promo Code Invalid/actions/2/subtext/2",
          "source_text": "Make sure to explain the result in natural language."
